WEBVTT

00:01.130 --> 00:03.980
Thank you for waiting.

00:04.300 --> 00:06.480
It's time for today's final match.

00:07.060 --> 00:11.110
Who will claim the remaining tickets?

00:11.490 --> 00:16.870
As this is the final match,
a lot of money is riding on this!

00:17.210 --> 00:21.320
The gamblers are desperately trying to 
gain any advantage in the next round!

00:21.320 --> 00:24.370
Now that's funky!

00:24.880 --> 00:28.770
In this match, most of the bets 
will be placed on Ran and Anaak.

00:28.770 --> 00:32.900
But it's hard to believe both will advance,

00:33.340 --> 00:35.890
making the odds 50-50.

00:36.110 --> 00:38.570
<i>Going all in and winning would be ideal,</i>

00:38.570 --> 00:40.890
<i>but I'll play it safe and bet low.</i>

00:40.890 --> 00:42.890
<b>Anaak Jahad</b>

00:41.910 --> 00:42.890
<i>No, wait.</i>

00:43.420 --> 00:45.120
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

00:45.440 --> 00:50.020
<i>That's right. I made it this far 
because I believed in my teammates.</i>

00:50.020 --> 00:52.030
<b>Anaak Jahad</b>

00:52.030 --> 00:53.830
All right. That should do it.

00:53.830 --> 00:55.030
Wait a minute.

00:55.790 --> 00:57.530
Isn't that Paracule?

00:57.530 --> 01:01.040
Since being separated from Rak 
during the previous game,

01:01.040 --> 01:03.520
I've tried to give up numerous times.

01:03.520 --> 01:06.830
But God did not forsake me!

01:06.830 --> 01:09.540
I overcame those challenges 
through incredible luck!

01:09.860 --> 01:12.800
Yes, all for this day!

01:14.130 --> 01:15.300
The time has come!

01:15.300 --> 01:18.550
I, Paracule, will start a 
revolution with a single blow!

01:18.550 --> 01:20.550
Let the match begin!

01:23.890 --> 01:26.440
Why are they coming this way?!

01:26.710 --> 01:28.440
What's up with him?

01:29.020 --> 01:31.630
He left with Rak.

01:31.630 --> 01:33.700
Does that mean Rak is here, too?

01:34.280 --> 01:36.450
I'm surprised he made it up here.

01:36.450 --> 01:40.090
While the match begins with a fierce battle,

01:40.090 --> 01:43.450
two competitors are strangely quiet.

01:44.640 --> 01:46.960
Anaak Jahad...

01:47.530 --> 01:48.950
and Khun Ran.

01:50.780 --> 01:54.530
A battle between two of the alleged 
strongest E-Rank Regulars...

01:54.870 --> 01:56.570
Aren't you in the top five, too?

01:57.140 --> 01:58.820
Who do you think will win?

01:58.820 --> 02:03.310
The lizard is stronger,
but Ran's technique is exceptional.

02:03.310 --> 02:06.480
It'll come down to whatever they 
have hidden up their sleeves.

02:07.300 --> 02:08.560
Hey, helmet.

02:09.870 --> 02:11.740
Are rule changes allowed?

02:11.740 --> 02:14.180
What do you mean?

02:14.180 --> 02:18.490
Let me fight one-on-one against 
her without the others.

04:00.010 --> 04:04.010
<b>Episode 19</b>

04:07.270 --> 04:09.350
The rules can't be changed.

04:09.350 --> 04:13.140
Betting has ended, and 
fairness must be maintained.

04:13.140 --> 04:15.280
If we're talking about fairness,

04:15.280 --> 04:19.090
the guys pitted against us probably 
have more than a few complaints.

04:21.570 --> 04:23.260
You've got me there.

04:23.770 --> 04:26.950
<i>Let's comply with his request.</i>

04:26.950 --> 04:30.200
<i>It's what the audience wants.</i>

04:30.720 --> 04:32.650
What about you, Anaak?

04:32.650 --> 04:35.690
Do you accept Ran's request for a duel?

04:35.690 --> 04:39.880
Of course, as long as the little 
blue boy isn't too scared.

04:40.260 --> 04:44.880
Then we'll allow Anaak Jahad and 
Khun Ran to fight one-on-one!

04:44.880 --> 04:51.110
Where'd you find the confidence 
to challenge me like this?

04:51.110 --> 04:54.140
Do you have some tricks 
prepared like last time?

04:54.140 --> 04:56.670
No, nothing this time.

04:58.260 --> 05:00.160
I'll just fight at full power.

05:00.160 --> 05:03.150
What is that, an ataractic or something?

05:03.150 --> 05:05.060
You won't need it.

05:05.060 --> 05:08.030
I'll kill you before you can even feel fear.

05:11.500 --> 05:15.620
If I kill you before you can 
swallow it, it'll be meaningless!

05:19.140 --> 05:20.950
You're nothing special.

05:20.950 --> 05:23.050
I needn't have held back out of caution.

05:25.210 --> 05:28.010
Don't hit me while I'm eating.

05:28.820 --> 05:32.710
People like you annoy the crap out of me.

05:35.000 --> 05:37.540
What's that thing that looks like a mole?

05:37.540 --> 05:40.290
Maybe that thing you ate had gone bad.

05:40.290 --> 05:45.450
You'll regret creating a situation 
that allows me to fight at full power.

05:53.700 --> 05:55.050
<i>What is he thinking?</i>

05:55.050 --> 05:56.490
<i>If he's unleashing so much 
lightning already,</i>

05:56.490 --> 05:58.180
<i>won't he run out of charge right away?</i>

05:58.180 --> 06:00.330
I'll show you, lizard...

06:00.650 --> 06:02.420
how much stronger than you I am!

06:07.360 --> 06:10.040
Are they really E-rank Regulars?

06:10.040 --> 06:13.540
Strictly speaking, they're like me,
but different from you.

06:14.120 --> 06:16.510
<i>He can't land a solid hit.</i>

06:16.510 --> 06:19.060
<i>He's digging his own grave.</i>

06:21.270 --> 06:25.150
Idiot! Close combat is my forte!

06:28.280 --> 06:29.780
You sure about that?

06:34.120 --> 06:35.790
You're mine!

06:41.130 --> 06:42.580
Why, you...

06:42.580 --> 06:44.880
Quit scurrying around!

06:52.510 --> 06:54.410
Anaak! You're kidding.

06:55.040 --> 06:57.140
She's being overwhelmed in close combat?

06:58.230 --> 06:59.890
What did he do?

07:00.600 --> 07:04.150
You're nothing like when we fought before.

07:05.100 --> 07:06.950
What exactly did you eat?

07:09.030 --> 07:10.250
A Lightning Pill.

07:10.640 --> 07:11.650
Lightning Pill?

07:12.000 --> 07:14.780
It's concentrated electric Shinsu.

07:15.800 --> 07:17.790
And you swallowed that?

07:18.110 --> 07:20.880
The Lightning Pill's electric 
current reacts to my body

07:20.880 --> 07:23.270
and temporarily boosts my strength.

07:24.010 --> 07:26.780
If they're incompatible, 
it can kill a person.

07:26.780 --> 07:29.800
It's my family's technique, 
available to only a select few.

07:30.490 --> 07:33.290
And this isn't a mole. It's a Trace.

07:34.020 --> 07:36.470
They appear on your body when 
you swallow a Lightning Pill.

07:36.470 --> 07:39.810
Right now, I'm several times 
faster and stronger than normal,

07:40.430 --> 07:43.310
but I can only sustain it for five minutes.

07:43.850 --> 07:47.090
After that, I can't even walk properly.

07:47.090 --> 07:49.820
Should you have revealed that weakness?

07:49.820 --> 07:52.300
You don't get it.

07:52.300 --> 07:55.660
Five minutes is plenty of time 
to beat someone like you.

07:56.070 --> 07:58.580
Why, you...

07:58.580 --> 08:00.830
I'll kill you!

08:05.570 --> 08:08.960
He's provoking you to draw you in!

08:12.800 --> 08:15.890
Imagine if you don't even last one minute!

08:23.980 --> 08:27.390
I can use Shinsu, too, you know!

08:29.320 --> 08:31.190
Don't do it, Anaak!

08:32.440 --> 08:34.320
Impressive as always, Ran.

08:34.320 --> 08:39.200
He has a complete grasp of Anaak's 
weaknesses after fighting her just once.

08:47.660 --> 08:50.960
Ran can fight under the effects of 
a Lightning Pill for five minutes.

08:51.760 --> 08:55.910
If Anaak had kept away from him for 
five minutes, Ran would've lost,

08:56.350 --> 08:59.450
but Ran was certain she wouldn't run.

09:01.310 --> 09:02.850
You bastard!

09:03.110 --> 09:05.450
You can't! Beat me!

09:07.520 --> 09:09.020
In my current state!

09:09.940 --> 09:11.440
This is the end!

09:20.080 --> 09:26.330
<b>Anaak Jahad</b>

09:20.080 --> 09:26.330
<b>Khun Ran</b>

09:21.550 --> 09:25.380
This duel went as I expected.

09:27.700 --> 09:28.990
Who are you?

09:29.390 --> 09:30.880
What are you doing in my room?

09:31.290 --> 09:35.670
I came to see you, Jue Viole Grace.

09:37.570 --> 09:39.360
My name is Beta.

09:39.720 --> 09:43.220
Like you, I'm a Living Ignition Weapon.

09:43.590 --> 09:44.650
You are?

09:44.650 --> 09:45.540
Yeah.

09:45.540 --> 09:46.910
You're lying!

09:46.910 --> 09:49.770
Horyang said that experiment was canceled.

09:49.770 --> 09:53.250
You really don't know anything, do you?

09:53.250 --> 09:57.010
I was so desperate to meet the "finished 
product," but I'm disappointed.

09:57.370 --> 09:58.470
Finished product?

09:58.850 --> 10:00.580
Think about it.

10:00.580 --> 10:04.070
Why would FUG bring you here?

10:04.070 --> 10:07.980
Why are they trying to 
win the Workshop Battle?

10:08.930 --> 10:12.760
What do you think is the 
prize they want so badly?

10:13.280 --> 10:16.380
If you asked, I'm sure they'd 
tell you about it...

10:17.230 --> 10:21.930
and the crime you committed against 
us that you must atone for.

10:23.060 --> 10:26.390
See you at the party, finished product.

10:28.620 --> 10:34.580
After a rapid flurry of blows, Khun Ran 
slammed Anaak Jahad into the arena floor!

10:34.580 --> 10:36.900
His power is on another level!

10:36.900 --> 10:39.130
Now that's funky!

10:40.250 --> 10:43.280
When I said my time limit was five minutes,

10:43.280 --> 10:47.730
you probably thought you had 
to defeat me within that time.

10:48.380 --> 10:52.510
Your pride wouldn't allow 
you to defeat me after that.

10:53.040 --> 10:57.590
As long as you cling to that pride,
you'll never defeat me.

10:58.140 --> 11:00.630
Don't think you can run 
your mouth like that.

11:03.260 --> 11:04.550
<i>You're kidding.</i>

11:04.970 --> 11:09.670
<i>I avoided hitting her heart, but she 
should be too badly wounded to get up.</i>

11:10.970 --> 11:13.810
You'll kill yourself.

11:14.770 --> 11:19.820
I don't refuse to run because I'm vain.

11:22.070 --> 11:25.250
It's because I can't.

11:33.860 --> 11:34.880
This is the end.

11:43.070 --> 11:46.140
<i>Where does she get that power from?</i>

11:48.240 --> 11:49.580
<i>This is unexpected.</i>

11:50.600 --> 11:52.390
What are you hesitating for?

11:52.890 --> 11:54.920
Hurry up and finish me off.

11:56.080 --> 12:00.410
Don't tell me you're afraid 
to fight a dying opponent.

12:00.800 --> 12:02.090
Don't make me laugh.

12:03.610 --> 12:05.410
I'll end you!

12:12.830 --> 12:15.830
After being forced into 
a difficult position,

12:15.830 --> 12:17.640
Anaak Jahad's adrenaline-fueled power

12:17.640 --> 12:21.590
brings about an unexpected development 
in the final moments of their battle!

12:21.590 --> 12:24.840
Which competitor will be victorious?

12:25.320 --> 12:29.820
<i>Without a doubt, Ran will win this match.</i>

12:28.220 --> 12:30.720
Khun Ran

12:32.140 --> 12:33.480
What is it?

12:33.960 --> 12:35.480
Come and get me.

12:35.480 --> 12:37.230
Are you scared?

12:38.980 --> 12:39.980
Ran?!

12:39.980 --> 12:41.470
Don't be absurd.

12:41.820 --> 12:44.820
I'm not afraid of you!

12:45.120 --> 12:47.820
Don't fall for her provocation!

12:49.400 --> 12:52.080
No one can predict the outcome now.

12:52.280 --> 12:54.190
With this single blow...

12:54.190 --> 12:55.850
With this single attack...

13:04.760 --> 13:07.760
Revolution!

13:07.760 --> 13:10.100
Long-term!

13:10.100 --> 13:11.100
Huh?

13:11.100 --> 13:12.060
What?

13:12.060 --> 13:14.550
Pa... Paracule?!

13:20.800 --> 13:23.380
I thought I'd die...

13:23.380 --> 13:24.530
Does this mean...

13:24.530 --> 13:27.660
They're both out?

13:31.030 --> 13:35.040
<b>What is the grand prize of this Workshop Battle?</b>

13:31.030 --> 13:35.040
<b>Emily
The grand prize of this Workshop Battle is Ignition Weapon "Jue Viole Grace."</b>

13:36.000 --> 13:39.160
<i>I love you... I love you...</i>

13:39.160 --> 13:40.020
What is that?

13:55.560 --> 13:56.730
<i>No choice but to fight.</i>

14:06.680 --> 14:09.100
<i>I can't do anything without a sword.</i>

14:09.480 --> 14:12.580
<i>But depending on how I use it,</i>

14:13.290 --> 14:15.110
<i>even a metal pipe like this...</i>

14:30.810 --> 14:35.350
<i>I have to forget what it is that I'm holding,</i>

14:35.810 --> 14:40.900
<i>because in this very moment, 
it is the ultimate sword.</i>

14:52.380 --> 14:53.200
Lightning Strike.

14:55.930 --> 14:59.060
<i>He instantly stopped the 
patrol from self-destructing.</i>

15:00.500 --> 15:02.890
Your skills have improved quite a bit,

15:02.890 --> 15:05.620
though you're still as reckless as ever.

15:05.620 --> 15:06.650
It can't be...

15:08.090 --> 15:09.460
Lero Ro!

15:09.460 --> 15:11.800
It's good to see you again, Hatz.

15:11.800 --> 15:13.720
What are you doing here?

15:13.720 --> 15:15.660
It's complicated.

15:15.970 --> 15:17.260
I guess so.

15:18.130 --> 15:22.160
Oh, right. Do you know 
how to get out of here?

15:22.700 --> 15:23.610
Yes.

15:23.610 --> 15:25.670
<i>The party will begin shortly.</i>

15:25.670 --> 15:27.450
<i>Security guards, gather in the lobby.</i>

15:29.420 --> 15:32.800
Could you help me with something, Hatz?

15:32.800 --> 15:35.010
Help you with what?

15:35.410 --> 15:39.380
I'm going to stop the creation 
of the worst weapon imaginable.

15:45.250 --> 15:46.900
Damn it.

15:47.270 --> 15:50.510
Why'd Khun have to drop out?

15:50.840 --> 15:53.660
That reptile ruined everything.

15:53.660 --> 15:55.760
I can't believe they both fell.

15:55.760 --> 15:59.140
What does that have to do with you, anyway?

15:59.770 --> 16:03.380
You advanced. Just join someone else's team.

16:03.380 --> 16:04.900
There's no point in that!

16:05.470 --> 16:07.210
It has to be this team.

16:07.610 --> 16:09.270
Did you place a bet or something?

16:09.270 --> 16:12.280
Why is that the only way you can see things?

16:13.050 --> 16:15.500
For now, let's trust Khun and wait.

16:15.500 --> 16:17.750
He's not the type to back down.

16:17.750 --> 16:18.970
He'll figure something out.

16:18.970 --> 16:20.830
I hope you're right.

16:23.570 --> 16:26.470
She's twice as cute up close.

16:26.470 --> 16:28.320
The real thing is cuter.

16:28.320 --> 16:30.440
She's certainly eye-catching,

16:30.440 --> 16:31.370
Princess!

16:30.860 --> 16:32.840
but she's a terrifying woman.

16:31.370 --> 16:32.840
Dance with me, princess!

16:33.730 --> 16:35.280
<i>Just listen to them.</i>

16:35.280 --> 16:37.350
<i>They're such easy prey.</i>

16:37.800 --> 16:40.820
You 100% genuine piece of trash!

16:40.820 --> 16:43.130
What did I do wrong?!

16:43.130 --> 16:45.350
All I did was start a revolution!

16:45.350 --> 16:47.230
Die! Die!

16:47.230 --> 16:49.310
You ruined everything!

16:49.310 --> 16:52.140
I was going to win and take 
back the black turtle!

16:52.140 --> 16:54.110
Stop! You'll really kill him!

16:52.290 --> 16:54.110
Die! Die! Die!

16:54.110 --> 16:57.690
Damn it! Now that we're in this situation...

16:58.560 --> 16:59.810
Huh? Where are you going?

16:59.810 --> 17:02.980
I don't give a crap about some 
promise with a FUG loser!

17:02.980 --> 17:05.050
I'm going to take back the 
black turtle right now!

17:05.050 --> 17:07.630
What? Wait! Don't leave me!

17:12.470 --> 17:14.170
Unbelievable.

17:14.170 --> 17:17.320
To think this many gamblers dropped out.

17:17.320 --> 17:20.330
Too much greed is a bad thing after all.

17:20.330 --> 17:23.640
But she seems to have passed.

17:27.750 --> 17:31.400
Damn it. I can't believe this idiot is 
advancing while I'm dropping out.

17:31.400 --> 17:32.780
I'm not an idiot!

17:33.110 --> 17:36.430
Hey, baldie! Quit banging on that thing!

17:37.580 --> 17:40.780
Sorry I'm late, gamblers.

17:41.000 --> 17:46.040
Or to be precise,
two gamblers and eight losers.

17:48.170 --> 17:50.890
We're not losers.

17:51.670 --> 17:57.050
Anaak Jahad and Khun Ran's duel was 
separate from the other Regulars.

17:57.400 --> 17:59.410
Paracule had already dropped out.

17:59.410 --> 18:01.680
His interference was against the rules.

18:01.680 --> 18:04.930
Therefore, this bet should be voided.

18:05.530 --> 18:07.370
The masked guy is right.

18:07.700 --> 18:10.780
The gamblers bet on the 
outcome of their duel.

18:10.780 --> 18:14.320
The duel was interrupted, 
so it should be voided.

18:14.320 --> 18:15.910
I see.

18:15.910 --> 18:22.610
Then allow me to suggest a new 
tournament rule for the eight losers.

18:22.610 --> 18:24.960
A new tournament rule?

18:24.960 --> 18:26.330
Oh, yes.

18:26.330 --> 18:30.080
I call it the Development Tournament.

18:31.770 --> 18:34.090
That idiot isn't even here!

18:34.690 --> 18:38.590
<i>I disguised myself to tail him, 
but he vanished in an instant.</i>

18:38.590 --> 18:43.600
Endorsi
Hey!
Endorsi
 Where is Jue Viole Grace?
Emily
At Archimedes Party Hall 32-1.

18:39.330 --> 18:43.600
<i>He must've realized I was 
following him and lost me.</i>

18:43.930 --> 18:46.110
How dare he trick me?

18:46.110 --> 18:48.940
Now I have to catch him no matter what!

18:51.350 --> 18:53.170
What an idiot.

18:53.990 --> 18:56.530
Hey, finished product. 
I'm surprised you made it.

18:57.200 --> 18:59.130
Did you use Emily to find me?

18:59.620 --> 19:05.170
This is the safest place to observe 
the location you gave Emily.

19:05.170 --> 19:07.370
So you're smart after all.

19:08.320 --> 19:12.880
I have questions about the 
Ignition Weapon inside me.

19:13.560 --> 19:16.970
If you want to know how 
to activate it, forget it.

19:16.970 --> 19:17.810
Huh?

19:17.810 --> 19:21.050
The Thorn inside you is just a replica.

19:21.050 --> 19:23.320
The Workshop has the real one.

19:23.320 --> 19:26.740
FUG wants you with that Thorn equipped.

19:27.140 --> 19:30.800
The real Thorn is inside 
that arena over there.

19:30.800 --> 19:37.150
Want me to tell you how to acquire 
the Thorn without returning to FUG?

19:38.150 --> 19:40.030
It's simple.

19:40.980 --> 19:42.740
You just have to steal it.

19:44.220 --> 19:47.040
What? A Development Tournament?

19:47.520 --> 19:51.460
The eight teams will fight in 
the Development Tournament.

19:51.460 --> 19:57.050
The winning team will face the winner between 
Team Mad Dog and Team FUG in the final.

19:57.380 --> 20:02.110
We'll use points earned through competition 
to develop our team and advance.

20:02.610 --> 20:04.930
What about Team FUG and Team Mad Dog?

20:05.450 --> 20:08.080
They'll face each other from the start.

20:08.080 --> 20:10.990
We came to fight them either way.

20:11.350 --> 20:12.940
We have no reason to object.

20:13.410 --> 20:15.940
The first person we'll send is...

20:16.400 --> 20:18.550
you, Wangnan.

20:18.550 --> 20:20.430
Huh? Me?

20:21.170 --> 20:23.450
All right. Let's do this.

20:24.600 --> 20:27.380
Where did that gator go now?

20:28.650 --> 20:31.630
So this is FUG's hotel.

20:31.630 --> 20:33.460
Are you really going in there?

20:33.460 --> 20:35.710
What if they find you?

20:35.710 --> 20:39.800
I can't keep relying on slow turtles.

20:39.800 --> 20:42.760
I'll take back the black turtle myself.

20:42.760 --> 20:43.840
Let's go!

20:44.650 --> 20:47.470
They're fast asleep.

20:50.280 --> 20:52.710
Ow...

20:52.710 --> 20:54.730
That hit like a tank.

20:56.910 --> 20:59.140
Huh? You're...

20:59.140 --> 21:02.240
Ghost Eyeball Turtle! 
What are you doing here?

21:02.240 --> 21:05.210
You're that gator, aren't you?

21:05.210 --> 21:07.350
N-No, I'm not.

21:07.350 --> 21:09.370
You clearly are.

21:09.370 --> 21:11.000
I'm not!

21:11.000 --> 21:12.090
Xia Xia?

21:18.850 --> 21:22.480
That gator better not be 
doing anything he shouldn't.

21:26.650 --> 21:29.450
You're alive...

23:02.710 --> 23:04.730
It's finally starting.

23:04.730 --> 23:09.470
We've waited so long to plunge 
him into despair ourselves.

23:09.470 --> 23:12.250
To crush what's important to him underfoot.

23:13.810 --> 23:16.630
Things won't go as you hope.

23:17.730 --> 23:19.330
Do you really think...

23:19.830 --> 23:22.710
you can trap me again?!

23:24.190 --> 23:26.000
Tell that woman!

23:26.000 --> 23:29.260
You're the one who turned us into weapons.

